=== NATURAL ===
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1 #AMT (P7.2)
1 #AMT_STR (A20)
END-DEFINE
MOVE EDITED #AMT TO #AMT_STR (EM=ZZZ,ZZ9.99-)

=== PYTHON ===
from decimal import Decimal

class NumericEditMaskContext:
    def __init__(self):
        self.amt = Decimal('0')
        self.amt_str = ""

def execute_numeric_edit_mask(ctx: NumericEditMaskContext, session):
    ctx.amt_str = f"{abs(ctx.amt):,.2f}{'-' if ctx.amt < 0 else ''}"
    return ctx

=== EXECUTE ===
- input:
    amt: "12345.67"
  expected:
    amt_str: "12,345.67"

- input:
    amt: "-450.50"
  expected:
    amt_str: "450.50-"
